&lt;li&gt;Contribute to daily and weekly sales targets while keeping customer satisfaction as the top priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay aware of best- and slow-selling products to guide recommendations and improve sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain excellent knowledge of the Soho Home brand, products, and seasonal collections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer queries with professionalism or refer to management when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep displays well-stocked and ensure the shop floor meets cleanliness and presentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly and efficiently retrieve stock from back-of-house as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
