&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze the effectiveness of online campaigns;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose optimization solutions for processes in order to achieve both internal and external goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #e03e2d;&quot;&gt;Desired Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in tech support, analytical roles, and campaign optimization within digital marketing - &lt;strong&gt;must have&lt;/strong&gt;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more programming languages (e.g. HTML, JavaScript, Apps Script, Python) or experience in the systems integration via API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with debugging tools (e.g. Google Chrome DevTools), Google Tag Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using Google Analytics 4, MMP knowledge will be an advantage;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&amp;nbsp;English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills are a must;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of motivation and willingness to learn;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good time management skills and attention to detail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
