&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Product team defines how millions of people experience Deliveroo, turning complex marketplace challenges into simple, high-impact solutions.&amp;nbsp;Working at the intersection of data, design and engineering, we set direction, prioritise what matters most, and deliver outcomes that move the business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Designer (Retail)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us shape the strategic vision for retail delivery, building brand-new shopping experiences and unlocking emerging categories to scale our marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Retail&lt;/strong&gt; team. Retail is a fast-growing, greenfield area for us beyond core restaurant and grocery delivery, helping people get almost anything delivered locally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Direction &amp;amp; Product Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead strategic design sprints to establish the foundation and execution plan for our 2027 product vision, defining how distinct retail categories and shopping formats feel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;Partner autonomously with Product, Engineering, and Business leaders as a trusted advisor to co-own the product roadmap and decide what we build and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Raise the design craft bar across the team by guiding team members, hosting critique sessions, and fostering a culture of high quality and detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Spot and resolve platform-wide systems challenges—such as accessibility, performance, and UI consistency—at scale across the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive studio-wide initiatives that shape overall design culture, recruitment practices, and the integration of AI into design workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-End Design Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of complex, ambiguous product initiatives from greenfield ideas to launch within fast-paced tech environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to act as a strategic partner to senior leadership, shaping business strategy and navigating competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Developing Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience coaching and mentoring designers to level up their craft while supporting autonomous growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Clear Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to articulate design rationale clearly to cross-functional stakeholders, from engineering leads to executive directors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
